# Cursor Rules - mattbutlerengineering

This project follows strict development guidelines for AI agents (Cursor, Claude, Gemini, etc.).

## Context
- Primary truth: [CLAUDE.md](./CLAUDE.md)
- Gemini specifics: [GEMINI.md](./GEMINI.md)
- General agents: [AGENTS.md](./AGENTS.md)
- Component catalog: [llms.txt](./llms.txt)

## Guidelines
- **Frameworks:** React (TypeScript), CSS Modules, Turborepo, pnpm.
- **Design System:** Use `@mbe/rialto` components exclusively. No Tailwind.
- **Commands:**
  - Build: `pnpm build`
  - Typecheck: `pnpm typecheck`
  - Test: `pnpm test`
- **Conventions:**
  - Packages use `@mbe/` prefix.
  - External resources use `mattbutlerengineering-` prefix.
  - Follow the Research -> Strategy -> Execution lifecycle.

## Code Style
- Use functional components and hooks.
- Prefer CSS Modules over inline styles.
- Always include `tabIndex={-1}` and `outline: none` for main content areas focus.
